    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Uveal melanoma metastasis, liver",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "The desmoplastic histopathological growth pattern as shown here is characterized by a well-defined annulus of desmoplasia separating the metastasis from the surrounding liver parenchyma.",
